{"version":1,"content":"<p>近日一名Reddit網友發帖爆料，自己在跨境電商平台AliExpress購買AMD鋭龍9 5950X處理器時遭遇了嚴重的詐騙事件。<strong>該網友在收到包裹後發現，內部裝載的並非其訂購的16核旗艦級處理器，而是一顆擁有10年歷史的AMD速龍X4。</strong>更氣人的是，買家申請全額退款，賣家還直接拒絕了。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583660.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-24T06:21:21.401783+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":149,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-24T06:16:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.021966+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-24T06:18:10.021966+00:00","content_hash":"cac54c651c46982d61d981083acbe2829bac82dea710f9f2b3041bbd7b1611df","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}